+expanded biography modules
+```
+
+### Robotics
+
+Decision owner:
+
+```text
+ops/SEEDWORKS_TECH_TREE_AUDIT_AND_HORIZON_GATES_V0_3_3.md
+```
+
+Supporting catalogs:
+
+```text
